window.Handbook.register({"id":"ch122","pages":[{"n":816,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"37\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">        uart0_ctsn: uart0-ctsn {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">            rockchip,pins =&lt;0 RK_PC7 3 &amp;pcfg_pull_none&gt;;/* uart0_ctsn */</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">        };</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">        /omit-if-no-ref/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">        uart0_rtsn: uart0-rtsn {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">            rockchip,pins =&lt;0 RK_PC4 3 &amp;pcfg_pull_none&gt;;/* uart0_rtsn */</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">        };</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">    };</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 816 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"816\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在第22 至36 行中描述的是uart0 所使用的引脚，其中uart0 节点下包含三个子节点uart0_xfer、uart0_ctsn 和uart0_rtsn，每个子节点定义了一组引脚。每组引脚可以包含一个或多个具体引脚，用于表示某一特定功能。例如，uart0_xfer 表示uart0 的收发引脚RX 和TX。一组引脚又叫做group，设备树中的group 节点除了标识引脚编号外，还定义了引脚的电气特性，如是否上拉、下拉、浮空等。例如，pcfg-pull-none 表示引脚内部浮空，pcfg_pull_up 表示开启内部上拉。uart0 节点也叫做function，function 表示引脚功能，如uart0 这个function 表示uart0所需引脚的复用设置和电气属性。在设备树中，function 和group 节点的配置通常由芯片厂商工程师编写并提供。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">设备树中只是设备的描述信息，pinctrl 驱动会获取设备树中pinctrl 的描述信息。根据rk3568.dtsi 设备树中pinctrl 节点的compatible 属性进行查找，可以查找到pinctrl 的驱动文件是内核源码的“/driver/pinctrl/pinctrl-rockchip.c”如图121.2 所示。</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图121.2\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0816-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图121.2\" width=\"975\" height=\"75\"></button><figcaption>图121.2 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b761\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第122 章pinctrl 子系统注册流程</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章节以iTOP-RK3568 开发板的SDK 为例分析pinctrl 子系统的注册流程。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b762\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">122.1 probe 函数分析</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">打开内核源码目录下的“/drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl-rockchip.c”驱动文件，找到驱动的入口函数rockchip_pinctrl_drv_register()，如代码清单122.1 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单122.1</p>"},{"n":817,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"19\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static struct platform_driver rockchip_pinctrl_driver = {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .probe      = rockchip_pinctrl_probe,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .driver = {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .name   = &quot;rockchip-pinctrl&quot;,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .pm = &amp;rockchip_pinctrl_dev_pm_ops,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">        .of_match_table = rockchip_pinctrl_dt_match,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    },</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">static int __init rockchip_pinctrl_drv_register(void)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return platform_driver_register(&amp;rockchip_pinctrl_driver);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">postcore_initcall(rockchip_pinctrl_drv_register);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">static void __exit rockchip_pinctrl_drv_unregister(void)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">    platform_driver_unregister(&amp;rockchip_pinctrl_driver);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 817 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"817\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">通过代码清单122.1 可以才看出pinctrl 驱动使用的是platform 总线，因此当pinctrl 设备和pinctrl 驱动匹配成功之后会执行rockchip_pinctrl_probe()函数，probe 函数如代码清单122.2 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单122.2</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"19\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static int rockchip_pinctrl_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rockchip_pinctrl *info;       // Rockchip GPIO 控制器的信息结构体指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device *dev = &amp;pdev-&gt;dev;     // 设备结构体指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rockchip_pin_ctrl *ctrl;      // Rockchip GPIO 控制器的配置结构体指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *np = pdev-&gt;dev.of_node, *node;        // 设备节点指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct resource *res;        // 设备资源指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    void __iomem *base;        // 寄存器基地址指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int ret;        // 返回值</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!dev-&gt;of_node) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(dev, &quot;device tree node not found\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -ENODEV;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 分配并初始化一个rockchip_pinctrl 结构体</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    info = devm_kzalloc(dev, sizeof(*info), GFP_KERNEL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!info)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -ENOMEM;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 817 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"817\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":818,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"20\" data-end=\"63\" data-contiguous=\"true\" data-recovered=\"pdf-text\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">212</span><span class=\"source-line\">        info-&gt;dev = dev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 获取并设置与 pdev 相关的 rockchip_pin_ctrl 结构体</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">        ctrl = rockchip_pinctrl_get_soc_data(info, pdev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (!ctrl) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 dev_err(dev, \"driver data not available\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 return -EINVAL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">        }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">        info-&gt;ctrl = ctrl;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 解析设备树中的\"rockchip,grf\"节点，获取寄存器映射基地址</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">        node = of_parse_phandle(np, \"rockchip,grf\", 0);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (node) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 info-&gt;regmap_base = syscon_node_to_regmap(node);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 if (IS_ERR(info-&gt;regmap_base))</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         return PTR_ERR(info-&gt;regmap_base);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 } else {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 如果找不到\"rockchip,grf\"节点，则获取 IORESOURCE_MEM 类型的资源，得到寄存器基地址</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 res = platform_get_resource(pdev, IORESOURCE_MEM, 0);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 base = devm_ioremap_resource(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, res);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 if (IS_ERR(base))</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         return PTR_ERR(base);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 配置寄存器映射的最大寄存器地址和名称</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 rockchip_regmap_config.max_register = resource_size(res) - 4;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 rockchip_regmap_config.name = \"rockchip,pinctrl\";</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 info-&gt;regmap_base = devm_regmap_init_mmio(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, base,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                          &amp;rockchip_regmap_config);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 检查旧的 dt-bindings</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 info-&gt;reg_size = resource_size(res);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 // 如果控制器类型为 RK3188 且 reg_size 小于 0x200，则获取第二个 IORESOURCE_MEM 类型的资</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">源，作为 pull 寄存器的基地址</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 if (ctrl-&gt;type == RK3188 &amp;&amp; info-&gt;reg_size &lt; 0x200) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         res = platform_get_resource(pdev, IORESOURCE_MEM, 1);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         base = devm_ioremap_resource(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, res);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         if (IS_ERR(base))</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 return PTR_ERR(base);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         // 配置 pull 寄存器映射的最大寄存器地址和名称</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         rockchip_regmap_config.max_register =</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                          resource_size(res) - 4;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">从原书文字层恢复 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"818\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><caption>原书第 818 页表格</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\">//</th><th scope=\"col\">检查旧的dt</th><th scope=\"col\">-bindings</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>info</td><td>-&gt;reg_size =</td><td>resource_size(r</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n"},{"n":819,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"103\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64</span><span class=\"source-line\">            rockchip_regmap_config.name = &quot;rockchip,pinctrl-pull&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65</span><span class=\"source-line\">            info-&gt;regmap_pull = devm_regmap_init_mmio(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66</span><span class=\"source-line\">                           base,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67</span><span class=\"source-line\">                           &amp;rockchip_regmap_config);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68</span><span class=\"source-line\">        }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 尝试查找可选的pmu syscon 引用</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72</span><span class=\"source-line\">    node = of_parse_phandle(np, &quot;rockchip,pmu&quot;, 0);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (node) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74</span><span class=\"source-line\">        info-&gt;regmap_pmu = syscon_node_to_regmap(node);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (IS_ERR(info-&gt;regmap_pmu))</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76</span><span class=\"source-line\">            return PTR_ERR(info-&gt;regmap_pmu);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 对于某些SoC 进行特殊处理</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ctrl-&gt;soc_data_init) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81</span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = ctrl-&gt;soc_data_init(info);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (ret)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83</span><span class=\"source-line\">            return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">84</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">85</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">86</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 注册rockchip_pinctrl 设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">87</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = rockchip_pinctrl_register(pdev, info);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">88</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">89</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">90</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">91</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 设置pdev 的私有数据为info</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">92</span><span class=\"source-line\">    platform_set_drvdata(pdev, info);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">93</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">94</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 注册GPIO 设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">95</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = of_platform_populate(np, rockchip_bank_match, NULL, NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">96</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">97</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to register gpio device\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">98</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">99</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">100</span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev_info(dev, &quot;probed %s\\n&quot;, dev_name(dev));</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">101</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">102</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">103</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 819 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"819\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单122.2 中第2 行出现的结构体struct rockchip_pinctrl 是瑞芯微公司为了适应瑞芯微芯片的特定需求和功能，对struct pinctrl_desc 结构体进行了再一次封装。封装后的struct rockchip_pinctrl 结构体在struct pinctrl_desc 的基础上增加了与瑞芯微芯片相关结构体成员。因</p>"},{"n":820,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">此struct pinctrl_desc 结构体可以看作是的struct rockchip_pinctrl 结构体的父类。通过这种方式Linux 的pinctrl 子系统对不同厂家的不同芯片都可以有很好的兼容性。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">rockchip_pinctrl 结构体定义在内核源码目录下的“/drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl-rockchip.h”文件中。如代码清单122.3 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单122.3</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"14\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct rockchip_pinctrl {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct regmap        *regmap_base;        // 基本寄存器映射指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int        reg_size;        // 寄存器大小</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct regmap        *regmap_pull;        // 拉取寄存器映射指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct regmap        *regmap_pmu;        // 电源管理单元寄存器映射指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device        *dev;        // 设备指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rockchip_pin_ctrl *ctrl;        // 瑞芯微芯片引脚控制器指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct pinctrl_desc     pctl;        // 引脚控制器描述符</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct pinctrl_dev      *pctl_dev;        // 引脚控制器设备指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rockchip_pin_group *groups;        // 瑞芯微芯片引脚组指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned int        ngroups;        // 引脚组数量</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rockchip_pmx_func *functions;        // 瑞芯微芯片引脚功能指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned int        nfunctions;        // 引脚功能数量</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 820 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"820\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">rockchip_pinctrl 结构体中关键成员介绍如下：1.struct device *dev：指向设备结构体的指针，并接入到设备模型中。2.struct rockchip_pin_ctrl *ctrl：指向rockchip_pin_ctrl 结构体类型的指针。rockchip_pin_ctrl 结构体保存了瑞芯微芯片的引脚信息和操作。如代码清单122.4 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单122.4</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"16\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct rockchip_pin_ctrl {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">        /* 引脚（Bank）信息*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct rockchip_pin_bank    *pin_banks;     // 指向bank 的结构体指针，如GPIO0 一组gpio 就</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">是看作是一个bank</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">        u32        nr_banks;       // bank 的数量</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">        u32        nr_pins;        // 控制器管理的总引脚数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">        char        *label;        // 控制器名称标识（如&quot;RK3568 pinctrl Control&quot;）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">        /* 硬件类型标识*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">        enum rockchip_pinctrl_type  type;        // 芯片平台类型（如RK3568/RK3399）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">        /* 寄存器偏移量配置*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">        int        grf_mux_offset;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">        int        pmu_mux_offset;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">        int        grf_drv_offset;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">        int        pmu_drv_offset;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 820 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"820\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":821,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"56\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">        /* 特殊引脚复用配置*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct rockchip_mux_recalced_data *iomux_recalced;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">        u32        niomux_recalced;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct rockchip_mux_route_data *iomux_routes;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">        u32        niomux_routes;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">        int (*ctrl_data_re_init)(struct rockchip_pin_ctrl *ctrl);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">        int (*soc_data_init)(struct rockchip_pinctrl *info);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">        /* 电气属性计算函数*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">        void (*pull_calc_reg)(struct rockchip_pin_bank *bank,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">                             int pin_num,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">                             struct regmap **regmap,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">                             int *reg,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">                             u8 *bit);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">        void (*drv_calc_reg)(struct rockchip_pin_bank *bank,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">                            int pin_num,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">                            struct regmap **regmap,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">                            int *reg,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">                            u8 *bit);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\">        int (*schmitt_calc_reg)(struct rockchip_pin_bank *bank,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\">                               int pin_num,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">                               struct regmap **regmap,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">                               int *reg,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">                               u8 *bit);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\">        int (*slew_rate_calc_reg)(struct rockchip_pin_bank *bank,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 int pin_num,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 struct regmap **regmap,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 int *reg,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                 u8 *bit);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 821 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"821\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">3.struct pinctrl_desc pctl：该结构体中的pctlops 成员是引脚控制相关的函数操作集，pmxops 成员是引脚复用控制的函数操作集，confops 成员是配置引脚电气特性的函数操作集。4.struct pinctrl_dev *pctl_dev：struct pinctrl_dev 用来表示一个pinctrl 设备。如代码清单122.5</p>"},{"n":822,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单122.5</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"27\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct pinctrl_dev {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct list_head node;        /* 通过该成员可以把pinctrl_dev 添加到全</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">局链表pinctrldev_list 中*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct pinctrl_desc *desc;        /* pin controller */</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct radix_tree_root pin_desc_tree;        /* 存储此pincontroller 下每个pin 对应的radix</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">树*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #ifdef CONFIG_GENERIC_PINCTRL_GROUPS        /* 可选*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct radix_tree_root pin_group_tree;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">            unsigned int num_groups;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #endif</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #ifdef CONFIG_GENERIC_PINMUX_FUNCTIONS        /* 可选*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct radix_tree_root pin_function_tree;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">            unsigned int num_functions;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #endif</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct list_head gpio_ranges;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct device *dev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct module *owner;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">            void *driver_data;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct pinctrl *p;        /* pinctrl_get(dev) 结果*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct pinctrl_state *hog_default;        /* 引脚的默认状态*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct pinctrl_state *hog_sleep;        /* 引脚的睡眠状态*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct mutex mutex;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #ifdef CONFIG_DEBUG_FS</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">            struct dentry *device_root;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #endif</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 822 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"822\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">5. struct rockchip_pin_group *groups：指向struct rockchip_pin_group 结构体类型的指针。该结构体表示一个引脚复用功能的引脚组。如代码清单122.6 所示</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单122.6</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"10\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">/**</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * struct rockchip_pin_group: represent group of pins of a pinmux function.</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @name: name of the pin group, used to lookup the group.</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @pins: the pins included in this group.</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @npins: number of pins included in this group.</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @func: the mux function number to be programmed when selected.</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @configs: the config values to be set for each pin</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @nconfigs: number of configs for each pin</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct rockchip_pin_group {</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 822 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"822\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":823,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"11\" data-end=\"15\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char        *name;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned int        npins;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned int        *pins;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rockchip_pin_config    *data;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 823 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"823\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">6.unsigned int ngroups：表示引脚组的大小。7.struct rockchip_pmx_func *functions：指向struct rockchip_pmx_func 结构体类型的指针。该结构体表示引脚可以设置的不同复用，例如UART、SPI、I2C 等。如代码清单122.7 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单122.7</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"11\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /**</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * struct rockchip_pmx_func: represent a pin function.</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @name: name of the pin function, used to lookup the function.</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @groups: one or more names of pin groups that provide this function.</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @num_groups: number of groups included in @groups.</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">     */</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rockchip_pmx_func {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char    *name;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char    **groups;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    u8        ngroups;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 823 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"823\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">8. unsigned int nfunctions：引脚对应的复用功能的数量。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此rockchip_pinctrl 结构体分析完毕。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在代码清单122.2 中调用rockchip_pinctrl_register()函数注册rockchip_pinctrl 设备。传入的参数分别为pdev 和rockchip_pinctrl 类型的info，rockchip_pinctrl_register()函数如代码清单122.8 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单122.8</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"14\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static int rockchip_pinctrl_register(struct platform_device *pdev,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">                     struct rockchip_pinctrl *info)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct pinctrl_desc *ctrldesc = &amp;info-&gt;pctl;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct pinctrl_pin_desc *pindesc, *pdesc;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rockchip_pin_bank *pin_bank;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int pin, bank, ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int k;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 初始化pinctrl 描述结构体</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ctrldesc-&gt;name = &quot;rockchip-pinctrl&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ctrldesc-&gt;owner = THIS_MODULE;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ctrldesc-&gt;pctlops = &amp;rockchip_pctrl_ops;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ctrldesc-&gt;pmxops = &amp;rockchip_pmx_ops;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 823 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"823\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":824,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"15\" data-end=\"52\" data-contiguous=\"true\" data-recovered=\"pdf-text\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">         ctrldesc-&gt;confops = &amp;rockchip_pinconf_ops;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">         // 为每个引脚分配内存</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">         pindesc = devm_kcalloc(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                         info-&gt;ctrl-&gt;nr_pins, sizeof(*pindesc),</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                         GFP_KERNEL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">         if (!pindesc)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  return -ENOMEM;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">         ctrldesc-&gt;pins = pindesc;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">         ctrldesc-&gt;npins = info-&gt;ctrl-&gt;nr_pins;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">         pdesc = pindesc;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">         // 遍历每个引脚所属的 bank，为每个引脚设置编号和名称</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">         for (bank = 0, k = 0; bank &lt; info-&gt;ctrl-&gt;nr_banks; bank++) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  pin_bank = &amp;info-&gt;ctrl-&gt;pin_banks[bank];</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  for (pin = 0; pin &lt; pin_bank-&gt;nr_pins; pin++, k++) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">                          pdesc-&gt;number = k;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">                          pdesc-&gt;name = kasprintf(GFP_KERNEL, \"%s-%d\",</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                    pin_bank-&gt;name, pin);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">                          pdesc++;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">         }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">         // 解析设备树中的 pinctrl 信息</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">         ret = rockchip_pinctrl_parse_dt(pdev, info);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">         if (ret)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  return ret;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\">         // 注册 pinctrl 设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">         info-&gt;pctl_dev = devm_pinctrl_register(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, ctrldesc, info);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">         if (IS_ERR(info-&gt;pctl_dev)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  dev_err(&amp;pdev-&gt;dev, \"could not register pinctrl driver\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  return PTR_ERR(info-&gt;pctl_dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\">         }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">         return 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">从原书文字层恢复 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"824\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">rockchip_pinctrl_register()关键部分讲解如下：</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第4 行：将info 的pctl 参数传递给了struct pinctrl_desc *类型的变量ctrldesc，从而使得r ockchip_pinctrl 结构体和pinctrl_desc 结构体建立了联系。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第11-15 行，对pinctrl_desc 结构体进行初始化。这些结构体成员包括name（pinctrl 控制</p>"},{"n":825,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">器的名称），owner（拥有该pinctrl 控制器的模块），pctlops（pinctrl 控制操作函数），pmxo ps（pinctrl 引脚复用操作函数）和confops（pinctrl 引脚配置操作函数）。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第18-22 行，使用devm_kcalloc 函数在设备的内存上分配一块连续的内存区域，用于存储pinctrl_pin_desc 结构体。该函数分配的内存大小为info-&gt;ctrl-&gt;nr_pins * sizeof(*pindesc)字节。如果内存分配失败，则返回-ENOMEM 错误码。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第24-25 行：将pinctrl_pin_desc 结构体的指针pindesc 赋值给pinctrl 描述结构体的pins 成员，将引脚数量info-&gt;ctrl-&gt;nr_pins 赋值给pinctrl 描述结构体的npins 成员。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第27-37 行：通过遍历每个引脚所属的bank，为每个引脚设置编号和名称。首先，定义变量pdesc 指向引脚描述结构体的起始地址。然后，使用两个嵌套的循环，外层循环遍历每个引脚所属的bank，内层循环遍历每个bank 中的引脚。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在内层循环中，首先将当前引脚的编号k 赋值给pinctrl_pin_desc 结构体的number 成员，然后使用kasprintf 函数动态分配内存储引脚名称的字符串，并将该字符串赋值给pinctrl_pin_d esc 结构体的name 成员。kasprintf 函数在内核堆中分配内存，并格式化生成字符串。格式化的字符串为&quot;%s-%d&quot;，其中pin_bank-&gt;name 是当前bank 的名称，pin 是当前引脚在bank 中的索引。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第39-42 行：调用rockchip_pinctrl_parse_dt()函数来解析设备树中的pinctrl 信息。该函数根据设备树中的描述，设置引脚的默认配置。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第45-49 行：调用devm_pinctrl_register()函数注册pinctrl 设备。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">其中devm_pinctrl_register()函数定义在内核源码目录下的“drivers/pinctrl/core.c”文件中，如代码清单122.9 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单122.9</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"12\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct pinctrl_dev *devm_pinctrl_register(struct device *dev,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">                       struct pinctrl_desc *pctldesc,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">                       void *driver_data)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct pinctrl_dev **ptr, *pctldev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 分配用于存储pinctrl_dev 指针的内存</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ptr = devres_alloc(devm_pinctrl_dev_release, sizeof(*ptr), GFP_KERNEL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!ptr)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ERR_PTR(-ENOMEM);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 注册pinctrl 设备</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 825 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"825\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":826,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"24\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pctldev = pinctrl_register(pctldesc, dev, driver_data);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (IS_ERR(pctldev)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">        devres_free(ptr);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return pctldev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 将pinctrl_dev 指针存储到devres 中</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    *ptr = pctldev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">    devres_add(dev, ptr);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return pctldev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 826 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"826\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">devm_pinctrl_register()函数关键部分解释如下：</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第8-10 行：使用devres_alloc()函数为存储pinctrl_dev 指针的变量ptr 分配内存。devres_al loc 函数是用于管理设备资源的函数。这里分配的内存大小为sizeof(*ptr)字节，即一个pinctrl_dev 指针的大小。如果内存分配失败，则返回-ENOMEM 错误码。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第13-17 行：调用pinctrl_register()函数注册pinctrl 设备。该函数将pinctrl_desc 结构体、设备指针dev 和驱动程序数据driver_data 作为参数，注册成功返回注册后的pinctrl_dev 指针。如果注册失败（返回错误码），则释放之前分配的内存，并返回相应的错误码。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第20-21 行：将pinctrl_dev 指针存储到ptr 指向的内存位置。接下来，使用devres_add()函数将ptr 添加到设备的资源列表中。这样，在设备释放时，会自动释放之前分配的内存。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后我们继续关注第13 行的pinctrl 设备注册函数pinctrl_register()注册pinctrl 设备，如代码清单122.10 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单122.10</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"14\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct pinctrl_dev *pinctrl_register(struct pinctrl_desc *pctldesc,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">                    struct device *dev, void *driver_data)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct pinctrl_dev *pctldev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int error;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 初始化pinctrl 控制器</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pctldev = pinctrl_init_controller(pctldesc, dev, driver_data);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (IS_ERR(pctldev))</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return pctldev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 启用pinctrl 控制器</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    error = pinctrl_enable(pctldev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (error)</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 826 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"826\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":827,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"15\" data-end=\"18\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ERR_PTR(error);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return pctldev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 827 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"827\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">pinctrl_register()函数关键部分解释如下：</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第8-10 行：调用pinctrl_init_controller()函数初始化pinctrl 控制器。该函数接受pinctrl_desc结构体、设备指针dev 和驱动程序数据driver_data 作为参数，并返回一个指向已初始化的pinctrl_dev 结构体的指针。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第13-15 行：调用pinctrl_enable()函数启用pinctrl 控制器。该函数接受一个pinctrl_dev 结构体指针作为参数，并返回一个代表错误码的整数值。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此，probe 函数的分析就完成了，这个时候可能大家还是感觉乱乱的，不知道probe 函数中到底是做了什么，大家不要着急，会在下面的章节中继续梳理pinctrl 子系统的框架。</p>"},{"n":828,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b763\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第123 章pinctrl_desc 结构体中函数操作集</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">上一章对probe 函数进行了讲解，probe 函数的实际作用就是注册并启用pinctrl，并且在probe 函数中会对pinctrl_desc 结构体中的函数操作集进行实现。本章对pinctrl_desc 结构体中的三个函数操作集进行详细的讲解。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b764\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">123.1 groups 和function</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在讲解pinctrl_desc 结构体中函数操作集之前需要先了解两个关键概念：引脚组（groups）和功能（function），在介绍pinctrl 子系统函数操作集之前，首先对groups 和function 进行讲解。1.引脚组（Groups）</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">引脚组是一组脚的集合，用于表示一种功能。每个引脚组通常与特定的硬件功能或外设相关联。例如，一个引脚组可以表示UART 功能或者SPI 功能。2.功能（Function）：</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">某一个具体功能的不同配置叫做function。举例说明</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">以rk3568-pinctrl.dtsi 设备树文件中的can0 和can1 两个功能为例对上面的内容进行举例，如代码清单123.1 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单123.1</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"12\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">can0 {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">            /omit-if-no-ref/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">            can0m0_pins: can0m0-pins {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">                rockchip,pins =</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">                    /* can0_rxm0 */</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">                    &lt;0 RK_PB4 2 &amp;pcfg_pull_none&gt;,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">                    /* can0_txm0 */</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">                    &lt;0 RK_PB3 2 &amp;pcfg_pull_none&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">            };</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">            /omit-if-no-ref/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">            can0m1_pins: can0m1-pins {</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 828 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"828\">核对原页</button></p></div>"}]});
